SUMMARY:[CBBA9006] 功課二「專業視頻」收集箱 due @ 23:59
DESCRIPTION:  視頻可選擇以下不同方式繳交：\n\nØ  直接將視頻檔案上載moodle (受限moodle設定，檔案須少於100MB)。\n\nØ  如視頻大於100MB，可將檔案分割，上載到Moodle的收集箱，惟請注意，受限於Moodle的設定，每位同學只可上載最多8個檔案。\n\nØ  將視頻上載至其他網上視頻平臺，並將連結資料填在「功課二工作紙」。請留意，如使用網上視頻平臺，請設定為「非公開視頻」，以免非必要人士瀏覽。\n
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[CBBA9006] 功課二「專業視頻」收集箱 due @ 23:59
TRIGGER:-PT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:10816777@moodle.hku.hk
DTSTAMP:20261112T031929Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261117
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[MKTG3502] [SUBMISSION] Final Group Project Materials (Slides\, Survey\, Raw Dataset) (Due Nov 16\, 7 PM) due @ 19:00
DESCRIPTION:	* ONE MEMBER OF THE GROUP SHOULD UPLOAD THE FILES ON BEHALF OF THE GROUP\n	* DON'T FORGET TO SUBMIT ALL 3 ELEMENTS (I.E.\, A TOTAL OF 3 FILES)\n	*\nFOR FILE NAMES\, REPLACE XX WITH YOUR GROUP NUMBER\n\n \n\n1. SLIDE DECK (PDF FILE OR .PPTX FILE) \n\n	* File name: Section A - Group XX - Slides\n	* Each slide should be readable\, including SPSS outputs\n	* Include slide page numbers\n\n2. SURVEY (PDF FILE)\n\n	* File name: Section A - Group XX - Survey\n	* How to print a Google Forms survey (to pdf) [1] - refer to the "Converting your form to PDF" section\n	* How to print a Qualtrics survey (to pdf) [2]\n	* If you used a data collection platform other than Google Forms or Qualtrics\, of course\, that's perfectly fine. Just make sure to figure out how to print your survey in PDF form and submit that\n\n3. SPSS DATASET (.SAV FILE OR .XLSX FILE)\n\n	* File name: Section A - Group XX - Data\n	* Submit THE RAW DATASET YOU HAVE DOWNLOADED FROM THE SURVEY PLATFORM. In other words\, do NOT delete or modify any data.\n\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] https://www.jotform.com/google-forms/how-to-save-a-google-form-as-a-pdf/\n[2] https://www.qualtrics.com/support/survey-platform/survey-module/survey-tools/print-survey/\n
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[MKTG3502] [SUBMISSION] Final Group Project Materials (Slides\, Survey\, Raw Dataset) (Due Nov 16\, 7 PM) due @ 19:00
TRIGGER:-PT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
